<div class="n-label">Downtown Niwot, such as it is</div>
<h1 class="n-display" id="title-h" style="margin-top:14px;font-size:clamp(1.875rem,1.4rem + 1.9vw,2.875rem);line-height:1.05;max-width:24ch;color:var(--n-evergreen)">Old Town Niwot</h1>
</div>
<div>
<p class="n-lead" style="margin:0;max-width:50ch">The brick and false-front buildings along Second Avenue, on a street grid laid out in 1875 to face a railroad. It is the oldest part of Niwot, and for a visitor with an afternoon it is most of what there is.</p>
