<h2 class="n-h2" id="parking-h" style="margin-top:12px;max-width:20ch;color:var(--n-evergreen)">Parking and walking</h2>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:14px 0 0;max-width:52ch">Street parking runs along Second Avenue, with lots serving the block. Free at the time of writing; posted restrictions apply. The avenue is walkable end to end in about ten minutes, with continuous sidewalks and short crossings.</p>
