<p class="n-body" style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:.9375rem">Italian on the 100 and 300 blocks, a coffeehouse at 136, ice cream at 240 and a bar with its own kitchen at 101 &#8212; with more of it on Cottonwood Square.</p>
<a class="n-link" href="/restaurants/" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:14px">Restaurants in Niwot <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
